---@class gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1alpha.DeleteProjectsLocationsCollectionsDataStoresControlsRequest
---@field name string Required. The resource name of the Control to delete. Format: `projects/{project}/locations/{location}/collections/{collection_id}/dataStores/{data_store_id}/controls/{control_id}`

---@class gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1alpha.DeleteProjectsLocationsCollectionsDataStoresConversationsRequest
---@field name string Required. The resource name of the Conversation to delete. Format: `projects/{project}/locations/{location}/collections/{collection}/dataStores/{data_store_id}/conversations/{conversation_id}`

---@class gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1alpha.DeleteProjectsLocationsCollectionsDataStoresRequest
---@field name string Required. Full resource name of DataStore, such as `projects/{project}/locations/{location}/collections/{collection_id}/dataStores/{data_store_id}`. If the caller does not have permission to delete the DataStore, regardless of whether or not it exists, a PERMISSION_DENIED error is returned. If the DataStore to delete does not exist, a NOT_FOUND error is returned.

---@class gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1alpha.DeleteProjectsLocationsCollectionsDataStoresSchemasRequest
---@field name string Required. The full resource name of the schema, in the format of `projects/{project}/locations/{location}/collections/{collection}/dataStores/{data_store}/schemas/{schema}`.

---@class gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1alpha.DeleteProjectsLocationsCollectionsDataStoresServingConfigsRequest
---@field name string Required. The resource name of the ServingConfig to delete. Format: `projects/{project}/locations/{location}/collections/{collection}/engines/{engine}/servingConfigs/{serving_config_id}`

---@class gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1alpha.DeleteProjectsLocationsCollectionsDataStoresSessionsRequest
