---@field jsonAgentCard? string Optional. The agent card is a JSON string.
---@field cloudMarketplaceConfig? gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1alpha.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1alphaA2AAgentDefinitionCloudMarketplaceConfig Optional. Configuration specific to agents that are deployed from Cloud Marketplace.

