---Informations to support actions on the connector.
---@class gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1alpha.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1alphaActionConfig
---@field useStaticSecrets? boolean Optional. Whether to use static secrets for the connector. If true, the secrets provided in the action_params will be ignored.
---@field customerManagedScopes? gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1alpha.StringList Optional. Customer-supplied OAuth scopes for connectors that opt into customer- managed scopes via ConnectorSource.enable_customer_managed_scopes. When non-empty on an opted-in connector, this list **replaces** the connector's built-in per-tool scopes: the OAuth authorization URL requests exactly these scopes for every operation, and the built-in scopes are never merged in. Ignored for connectors that do not opt in.
---@field isActionConfigured? boolean Output only. The connector contains the necessary parameters and is configured to support actions.
---@field userDefinedScopesMapping? gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1alpha.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1alphaActionConfigScopeListMap Optional. Mapping from operation name to the list of scopes. Only be populated if there are user specified scopes.
---@field createBapConnection? boolean Optional. Whether to create a BAP connection for the connector.
