---@alias gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1alpha.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1alphaAdvancedCompleteQueryRequestSuggestionTypesItemEnum "SUGGESTION_TYPE_UNSPECIFIED"|"QUERY"|"PEOPLE"|"CONTENT"|"RECENT_SEARCH"|"GOOGLE_WORKSPACE"

---@alias gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1alpha.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1alphaAdvancedCompleteQueryRequestSuggestionTypesItemEnumList (gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1alpha.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1alphaAdvancedCompleteQueryRequestSuggestionTypesItemEnum|string)[]

