---An experiment is a single run of the AlphaEvolve agent, an evolutionary coding agent powered by LLM for algorithm discovery and optimization.
---@class gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1alpha.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1alphaAlphaEvolveExperiment
---@field initialAlphaEvolveProgram? string Output only. Specifies the name of the seed program used to start the experiment.
---@field config? gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1alpha.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1alphaAlphaEvolveExperimentConfig Required. Experiment configuration.
---@field state? gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1alpha.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1alphaAlphaEvolveExperimentStateEnum Output only. The state of the experiment.
---@field name? string Identifier. The full resource name of the experiment. Format: `projects/{project}/locations/{location}/collections/{collection}/engines/{engine}/sessions/{session}/alphaEvolveExperiments/{alpha_evolve_experiment}`
---@field stats? gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1alpha.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1alphaAlphaEvolveExperimentStats Output only. Experiment stats.
---@field createTime? string Output only. Time when the experiment was created.

---Configuration of an experiment.
---@class gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1alpha.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1alphaAlphaEvolveExperimentConfig
---@field evolutionSettings? gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1alpha.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1alphaAlphaEvolveExperimentConfigEvolutionSettings Optional. Evolution settings for the experiment.
---@field runSettings? gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1alpha.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1alphaAlphaEvolveExperimentConfigRunSettings Required. Run settings for the experiment, controlling the overall behavior of the experiment run.
---@field title? string Required. Title of the experiment.
---@field problemDescription? string Required. Description of the problem to be solved by the experiment.
---@field generationSettings? gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1alpha.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1alphaAlphaEvolveExperimentConfigGenerationSettings Optional. Generation settings for the experiment, controlling how new program candidates are generated, including things LLM parameters and user-provided context and prompts.
---@field programLanguage? string Required. Primary programming language of the code being optimized.

---Evolution settings for the experiment.
---@class gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1alpha.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1alphaAlphaEvolveExperimentConfigEvolutionSettings
---@field parentSamplingConfig? gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1alpha.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1alphaAlphaEvolveExperimentConfigEvolutionSettingsParentSamplingConfig Optional. Parent sampling configuration.

---Configuration for parent sampling.
---@class gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1alpha.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1alphaAlphaEvolveExperimentConfigEvolutionSettingsParentSamplingConfig
---@field paretoSamplingConfig? gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1alpha.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1alphaAlphaEvolveExperimentConfigEvolutionSettingsParentSamplingConfigParetoSamplingConfig Optional. Pareto sampling configuration.

---Configuration for Pareto sampling.
---@class gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1alpha.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1alphaAlphaEvolveExperimentConfigEvolutionSettingsParentSamplingConfigParetoSamplingConfig
---@field paretoSamplingProbability? number Optional. Probability [0.0, 1.0] of sampling parent programs from the Pareto frontier instead of normal fitness-based sampling during candidate generation. Useful when optimizing multiple metrics simultaneously. Default 0.0 (disabled). Only effective when evaluation returns multiple metrics in scores_to_optimize.

---Generation settings for the experiment.
---@class gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1alpha.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1alphaAlphaEvolveExperimentConfigGenerationSettings
---@field includeFullProgramInPrompt? boolean Optional. When true, the LLM prompt includes the full program text (both mutable EVOLVE-BLOCK regions and immutable boilerplate). When false (default), only the mutable EVOLVE-BLOCK regions are shown, saving context window.
---@field context? string Optional. Additional user-provided context to be used during generation.
---@field models? gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1alpha.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1alphaAlphaEvolveExperimentConfigGenerationSettingsModelConfigList Optional. Per-model configuration. See `ModelConfig` for details. If left unset, the server selects a default model.

---Per-model configuration. Mutually exclusive with `model_mixture` and `model`: when `models` is set, both `model_mixture` and `model` must be left unset. The same allowed-model list and at-most-2-models rule as for `model_mixture` apply. In addition, each entry may specify a per-model `temperature` for LLM sampling. Unlike `model_mixture`, weights here are *relative*: only their ratios matter (the server normalizes them), so callers may use any positive numbers without having to ensure they sum to 1.0.
---@class gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1alpha.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1alphaAlphaEvolveExperimentConfigGenerationSettingsModelConfig
---@field thinkingLevel? gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1alpha.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1alphaAlphaEvolveExperimentConfigGenerationSettingsModelConfigThinkingLevelEnum|string Optional. Sent as Vertex `ThinkingConfig.thinking_level`.
---@field weight? number Optional. Relative weight for this model in the mixture. Must be a finite, strictly positive value. Weights across all entries are normalized server-side, so they need not sum to 1.0. Defaults to 1.0 when unset, which is convenient when configuring a single model or an even mixture. Some Pro-tier models are capped at most 50% of the total weight; requests violating that cap are rejected with INVALID_ARGUMENT.
---@field name? string Required. Model name (e.g. `gemini-2.5-flash`, `gemini-3.1-pro-preview`). See `model_mixture` for the list of allowed models.

---@alias gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1alpha.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1alphaAlphaEvolveExperimentConfigGenerationSettingsModelConfigList gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1alpha.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1alphaAlphaEvolveExperimentConfigGenerationSettingsModelConfig[]

---@alias gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1alpha.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1alphaAlphaEvolveExperimentConfigGenerationSettingsModelConfigThinkingLevelEnum "THINKING_LEVEL_UNSPECIFIED"|"MINIMAL"|"LOW"|"MEDIUM"|"HIGH"

---Run settings for the experiment.
---@class gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1alpha.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1alphaAlphaEvolveExperimentConfigRunSettings
---@field concurrency? number Required. Maximum number of programs that can be generated in parallel. Must be positive.
---@field maxDuration? string Optional. Maximum duration of the experiment. If unset, defaults to 24 hours.
---@field maxPrograms? number Required. Maximum number of programs to generate during the experiment run. The initial program counts towards this limit. Must be greater than 1.

---@alias gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1alpha.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1alphaAlphaEvolveExperimentList gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1alpha.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1alphaAlphaEvolveExperiment[]

---@alias gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1alpha.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1alphaAlphaEvolveExperimentStateEnum "STATE_UNSPECIFIED"|"CREATED"|"RUNNING"|"PAUSED"|"COMPLETED"|"FAILED"

