---@field verdict? gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1alpha.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1alphaAssistAnswerCustomerPolicyEnforcementResultVerdictEnum|string Final verdict of the customer policy enforcement. If at least one policy blocked the processing, the verdict is BLOCK. If no policy blocked the processing but at least one flagged it, the verdict is FLAG.
