---@field defaultModelId? string Optional. The default model to use for assistant.
---@field systemInstruction? gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1alpha.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1alphaAssistantGenerationConfigSystemInstruction System instruction, also known as the prompt preamble for LLM calls. See also https://cloud.google.com/vertex-ai/generative-ai/docs/learn/prompts/system-instructions
---@field allowedModelIds? gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1alpha.StringList Optional. The list of models that are allowed to be used for assistant.
---@field defaultLanguage? string The default language to use for the generation of the assistant response. Use an ISO 639-1 language code such as `en`. If not specified, the language will be automatically detected.

---System instruction, also known as the prompt preamble for LLM calls.
---@class gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1alpha.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1alphaAssistantGenerationConfigSystemInstruction
---@field additionalSystemInstruction? string Optional. Additional system instruction that will be added to the default system instruction.

