---@field mimeType? string The mime type of the document. https://www.iana.org/assignments/media-types/media-types.xhtml.
---@field uri? string URI for the document. It may contain a URL that redirects to the actual website.
---@field pageIdentifier? string Page identifier.
---@field title? string Title.

