---@field documentCounts? gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1alpha.StringMap The number of documents in a given branch. The key is a group representing a set of documents, and the value is the number of document in that group. Note: keys in this map may change over time. Supported keys: ['all'].

---@alias gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1alpha.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1alphaBranchList gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1alpha.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1alphaBranch[]

---Canned query resource of Assistant. It represents a short-cut to a predefined conversation start.
