---@alias gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1alpha.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1alphaCannedQueryCannedQueryTextsMap { [string]: gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1alpha.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1alphaCannedQueryCannedQueryTexts }

