---@field structData? gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1alpha.DocumentMap Data representation. The structured JSON data for the document. It should conform to the registered Schema or an `INVALID_ARGUMENT` error is thrown.
---@field mimeType? string The mime type of the document. https://www.iana.org/assignments/media-types/media-types.xhtml.
---@field uri? string Uri of the document.

---@alias gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1alpha.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1alphaChunkList gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1alpha.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1alphaChunk[]

