---A custom attribute that is not explicitly modeled in a resource, e.g. UserEvent.
---@class gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1alpha.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1alphaCustomAttribute
---@field text? gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1alpha.StringList The textual values of this custom attribute. For example, `["yellow", "green"]` when the key is "color". Empty string is not allowed. Otherwise, an `INVALID_ARGUMENT` error is returned. Exactly one of CustomAttribute.text or CustomAttribute.numbers should be set. Otherwise, an `INVALID_ARGUMENT` error is returned.
