---@field defaultAccess? gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1alpha.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1alphaEngineFeaturePolicyDefaultAccessEnum|string Optional. Access for users who match neither list.
---@field allowedMembers? gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1alpha.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1alphaEngineFeaturePolicyMemberList Optional. Members who may use the feature.

---@alias gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1alpha.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1alphaEngineFeaturePolicyDefaultAccessEnum "DEFAULT_ACCESS_UNSPECIFIED"|"ALLOW"|"DENY"

