---An evaluation is a single execution (or run) of an evaluation process. It encapsulates the state of the evaluation and the resulting data.
---@class gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1alpha.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1alphaEvaluation
---@field error? gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1alpha.GoogleRpcStatus Output only. The error that occurred during evaluation. Only populated when the evaluation's state is FAILED.
---@field qualityMetrics? gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1alpha.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1alphaQualityMetrics Output only. The metrics produced by the evaluation, averaged across all SampleQuerys in the SampleQuerySet. Only populated when the evaluation's state is SUCCEEDED.
---@field endTime? string Output only. Timestamp the Evaluation was completed at.
---@field evaluationSpec? gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1alpha.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1alphaEvaluationEvaluationSpec Required. The specification of the evaluation.
---@field name? string Identifier. The full resource name of the Evaluation, in the format of `projects/{project}/locations/{location}/evaluations/{evaluation}`. This field must be a UTF-8 encoded string with a length limit of 1024 characters.
---@field errorSamples? gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1alpha.GoogleRpcStatusList Output only. A sample of errors encountered while processing the request.
---@field createTime? string Output only. Timestamp the Evaluation was created at.
---@field state? gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1alpha.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1alphaEvaluationStateEnum Output only. The state of the evaluation.

---Describes the specification of the evaluation.
---@class gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1alpha.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1alphaEvaluationEvaluationSpec
---@field searchRequest? gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1alpha.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1alphaSearchRequest Required. The search request that is used to perform the evaluation. Only the following fields within SearchRequest are supported; if any other fields are provided, an UNSUPPORTED error will be returned: * SearchRequest.serving_config * SearchRequest.branch * SearchRequest.canonical_filter * SearchRequest.query_expansion_spec * SearchRequest.spell_correction_spec * SearchRequest.content_search_spec * SearchRequest.user_pseudo_id
---@field querySetSpec? gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1alpha.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1alphaEvaluationEvaluationSpecQuerySetSpec Optional. The specification of the query set.

---Describes the specification of the query set.
