---@field comment? string Optional. The additional user comment of the feedback.
---@field feedbackType? gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1alpha.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1alphaFeedbackFeedbackTypeEnum|string Required. Indicates whether the user gives a positive or negative feedback.
