---@field authorizationUri? string The authorization uri for the data connector.
---@field app? string The app name of the associated Connector.
---@field tenantId? string The tenant id of the associated Connector.
---@field clientId? string The client id of the associated Connector.
---@field instance? string The instance name of the associated Connector.

