---@class gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1alpha.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1alphaIdpConfig
---@field idpType? gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1alpha.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1alphaIdpConfigIdpTypeEnum|string Identity provider type configured.
---@field externalIdpConfig? gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1alpha.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1alphaIdpConfigExternalIdpConfig External Identity provider config.

