---@class gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1alpha.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1alphaRecommendResponse
---@field attributionToken? string A unique attribution token. This should be included in the UserEvent logs resulting from this recommendation, which enables accurate attribution of recommendation model performance.
---@field missingIds? gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1alpha.StringList IDs of documents in the request that were missing from the default Branch associated with the requested ServingConfig.
---@field results? gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1alpha.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1alphaRecommendResponseRecommendationResultList A list of recommended Documents. The order represents the ranking (from the most relevant Document to the least).
---@field validateOnly? boolean True if RecommendRequest.validate_only was set.

---RecommendationResult represents a generic recommendation result with associated metadata.
