---@field metadata? gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1alpha.DocumentMap Additional Document metadata or annotations. Possible values: * `score`: Recommendation score in double value. Is set if `returnScore` is set to true in RecommendRequest.params.
---@field id? string Resource ID of the recommended Document.

---@alias gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1alpha.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1alphaRecommendResponseRecommendationResultList gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1alpha.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1alphaRecommendResponseRecommendationResult[]

