---A data requirement.
---@class gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1alpha.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1alphaRequirement
---@field description? string The description of the requirement.
---@field displayName? string The name of the requirement.
---@field metricBindings? gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1alpha.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1alphaRequirementMetricBindingList A list of the metric bindings to be used in `condition`.
---@field severity? gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1alpha.StringList The severity of errors if the requirement is not met. It must be ordered from the most strict to the least strict. Examples: * `BLOCKING` * `CRITICAL` * `WARNING` All thresholds in the requirement must have all the severity here.
---@field thresholdBindings? gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1alpha.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1alphaRequirementThresholdBindingList A list of threshold bindings to be used in `condition`.
---@field type? string The requirement type, used as an identifier. Must be unique. The type should prefix with service name to avoid possible collision. It's encouraged to use natural hierarchical grouping for similar requirements. Examples: * `library.googleapis.com/books/min_available_books` * `discoveryengine.googleapis.com/media_rec/recommended_for_you/conversion_rate`
---@field condition? gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1alpha.GoogleTypeExpr The condition for evaluating the requirement result. Variables in the expression should be provided by `metrics_bindings` or `threshold_bindings`. Where `metrics_bindings` are used for computed metrics and `threshold_bindings` are used to define thresholds for corresponding `metric_bindings`.
---@field violationSamplesBindings? gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1alpha.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1alphaRequirementViolationSamplesBindingList A list of the metric bindings to be used in `condition`.

---Specifies a metrics query and bind its result to a variable which will be used in the `condition`.
---@class gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1alpha.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1alphaRequirementMetricBinding
---@field variableId? string The variable id to be referenced in `condition`.
---@field metricFilter? string The filter string used for metrics query. Example: "metric.type = \"discoveryengine.googleapis.com/events/day_count\" AND " "metric.conditions.time_range = \"NINETY_DAYS\""
---@field category? string The category of the metric's target resource. Example: "Events"
---@field resourceType? string The resource being monitored for the metric.
---@field description? string Human readable description of the corresponding metric filter.

---@alias gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1alpha.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1alphaRequirementMetricBindingList gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1alpha.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1alphaRequirementMetricBinding[]

---Specifies a multi-level threshold to apply to apply to a `metric_bindings` in the `condition` CEL expression.
---@class gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1alpha.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1alphaRequirementThresholdBinding
---@field variableId? string The variable id to be referenced in `condition`. Must be unique across all `metric_bindings` and `threshold_bindings`.
---@field thresholdValues? gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1alpha.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1alphaRequirementThresholdBindingThresholdValueList The values of the threshold. The values should be ordered from the most strict to the least strict.
---@field description? string Human readable description of the corresponding threshold and sub-requirement.

---@alias gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1alpha.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1alphaRequirementThresholdBindingList gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1alpha.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1alphaRequirementThresholdBinding[]

---Specifies a threshold value for a given severity.
---@class gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1alpha.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1alphaRequirementThresholdBindingThresholdValue
---@field value? number The value of the threshold.
---@field severity? string The severity of errors if the threshold is not met. It should be one of the `severity` fields in the requirement.

---@alias gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1alpha.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1alphaRequirementThresholdBindingThresholdValueList gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1alpha.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1alphaRequirementThresholdBindingThresholdValue[]

---Specifies a samples query and bind its result to a variable which will be used in the `condition`.
---@class gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1alpha.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1alphaRequirementViolationSamplesBinding
---@field description? string Description of this sample binding. Used by the UI to render user friendly descriptions for each requirement condition. Should be less than 128 characters long.
---@field variableId? string The variable id to be referenced in `condition`.
---@field sampleFilter? string The filter string used for samples query. Example: "sample.type = \"retail.googleapis.com/user_event\" AND " "sample.labels.event_type = \"PURCHASE\" "

---@alias gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1alpha.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1alphaRequirementViolationSamplesBindingList gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1alpha.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1alphaRequirementViolationSamplesBinding[]

