---@alias gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1alpha.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1alphaSearchResponseGeoSearchDebugInfoList gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1alpha.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1alphaSearchResponseGeoSearchDebugInfo[]

