---The filters that were extracted from the input query represented in a structured form.
---@class gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1alpha.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1alphaSearchResponseNaturalLanguageQueryUnderstandingInfoStructuredExtractedFilter
