---@alias gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1alpha.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1alphaStreamAssistResponseConnectorAuthErrorList gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1alpha.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1alphaStreamAssistResponseConnectorAuthError[]

