---Suggestion deny list entry identifying the phrase to block from suggestions and the applied operation for the phrase.
---@class gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1alpha.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1alphaSuggestionDenyListEntry
---@field matchOperator? gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1alpha.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1alphaSuggestionDenyListEntryMatchOperatorEnum|string Required. The match operator to apply for this phrase. Whether to block the exact phrase, or block any suggestions containing this phrase.
---@field blockPhrase? string Required. Phrase to block from suggestions served. Can be maximum 125 characters.

---@alias gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1alpha.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1alphaSuggestionDenyListEntryList gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1alpha.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1alphaSuggestionDenyListEntry[]

