---@field serviceTermsMap? gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1alpha.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1alphaProjectServiceTermsMap Output only. A map of terms of services. The key is the `id` of ServiceTerms.
---@field customerProvidedConfig? gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1alpha.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1alphaProjectCustomerProvidedConfig Optional. Customer provided configurations.
---@field createTime? string Output only. The timestamp when this project is created.
---@field experienceState? gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1alpha.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1alphaProjectExperienceStateEnum|string Output only. The current experience state of the project.
---@field configurableBillingStatus? gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1alpha.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1alphaProjectConfigurableBillingStatus Output only. The current status of the project's configurable billing.
---@field updateMask? string Optional. The list of fields to update. Supported fields: * `customer_provided_config` * `customer_provided_config.notebooklm_config.observability_config`
---@field name string Output only. Full resource name of the project, for example `projects/{project}`. Note that when making requests, project number and project id are both acceptable, but the server will always respond in project number.

---@class gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1alpha.PauseProjectsLocationsCollectionsEnginesRequest
