---@field body? gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1alpha.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1alphaPauseEngineRequest Request body

---@class gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1alpha.ProvisionProjectsLocationsRequest
