---@class gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1alpha.StreamAssistProjectsLocationsCollectionsEnginesAssistantsRequest
---@field actionSpec? gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1alpha.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1alphaStreamAssistRequestActionSpec Optional. Specification of actions for the request.
---@field toolsSpec? gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1alpha.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1alphaStreamAssistRequestToolsSpec Optional. Specification of tools that are used to serve the request.
---@field generationSpec? gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1alpha.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1alphaStreamAssistRequestGenerationSpec Optional. Specification of the generation configuration for the request.
---@field query? gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1alpha.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1alphaQuery Optional. Current user query. Empty query is only supported if `file_ids` are provided. In this case, the answer will be generated based on those context files.
---@field session? string Optional. The session to use for the request. If specified, the assistant has access to the session history, and the query and the answer are stored there. If `-` is specified as the session ID, or it is left empty, then a new session is created with an automatically generated ID. Format: `projects/{project}/locations/{location}/collections/{collection}/engines/{engine}/sessions/{session}`
---@field agentsSpec? gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1alpha.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1alphaStreamAssistRequestAgentsSpec Optional. Specification of agents that are used to serve the request.
---@field userMetadata? gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1alpha.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1alphaAssistUserMetadata Optional. Information about the user initiating the query.
---@field name string Required. The resource name of the Assistant. Format: `projects/{project}/locations/{location}/collections/{collection}/engines/{engine}/assistants/{assistant}`

